Kila mfuko kina uzani wa pauni 50. Kila pauni moja ya vitunguu ni $1.50. Kila mfuko alitumia:

$$
50 \times 1.50 = 75 \text{ dollar}
$$

Kila mpishi huyo alitumia 4 mfuko, mafaka ya:

$$
4 \times 75 = 300 \text{ dollar}
$$

Jibu: \boxed{300}
